// The 15-level vertical mall (w102411832, 90 m in OSM) on its footprint south of the tower: the multi-faceted yellow granite walls,
// the nine-storey glass atrium against the tower with the curved steel roof and the long "Xpresscalators" behind the glass.
// The hotel tower west of the mall is not modelled (the app's extruded footprint stays).
